<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Wefox鉅灣企業登入有使用Facebook登入應用聲明及教學</span><br><br>我們不會在我們的伺服器裡保存您的個人資料，但是依循Facebook的政策，我們必須提供 “Facebook資料刪除指示的教學說明” 。</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">如果您想刪除與</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Wefox鉅灣企業</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有關的Facebook登入應用數據，您可以依照以下步驟進行：</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">1. 進入您的Facebook帳號的 “設定和隱私 “選單。點擊 “設定”</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2. 向下滾動並點擊 “應用程式和網站”</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">3. 找到並點擊 “</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Wefox鉅灣企業</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">”</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">4. 點擊 “移除 “按鈕</span><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><br style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">恭喜您，您已經成功的刪除了您與</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Wefox鉅灣企業</span><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-family: Muli, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">應用程式活動。</span><br></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div>